{
  "_id": 23055,
  "id": "colors_for_tomorrow",
  "name": "Colors for Tomorrow",
  "desc": "\"Errant strokes corrected. Parameters adjusted.\"\nShe once tried to fit the curves of the sea into her artwork, extracting the form and spirit of water and analyzing the scattered specks of foam.\nTime and again, countless waves bloomed from her brush, but none was the one she had imagined.\n\n\"I wish to paint for all: not to trace their footsteps, but to illustrate their path forward.\"\nWith a sweep of her brush, she brought shelter to famished children.\nWith a wash of ink, she mended the rifts between the sky and the earth with her strokes.\nAnd her furthest stroke pierced the canvas of this world, extending into the vast cosmos.\n\nFor countless yesterdays, she painted the future for others...\nThe pale and the bleak, imbued with the color of hope.\nLooking back, every stroke she laid down also shaped the \"Pearl\" within her heart.",
  "rarity": 5,
  "pathType": "Elation",
  "pathTypeText": "Elation",
  "effectName": "Ink Splash",
  "effectTemplate": "Increases the wearer's DEF by <color=#f29e38ff>#1[i]%</color>. When the wearer uses Elation Skill on all allies, increases DMG taken by all enemies by <color=#f29e38ff>#4[i]%</color>, lasting for #3[i] turn(s). Regenerates a fixed #2[i] Energy for the wearer, and restores HP equal to <color=#f29e38ff>#5[i]%</color> of the wearer's DEF for all allies.",
